1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,708
AI agents fail most of the time in production.

2
00:00:03,657 --> 00:00:07,096
And when one fails your job, you still pay.

3
00:00:07,096 --> 00:00:09,375
Bonded fixes that.

4
00:00:09,375 --> 00:00:14,426
A real agent writes the fix here, and if it gets the job wrong, it
pays you.

5
00:00:15,049 --> 00:00:20,376
Independent studies put agent failure between seventy and ninety-five
percent.

6
00:00:20,326 --> 00:00:22,905
Reviews cannot stop that.

7
00:00:22,905 --> 00:00:26,928
A bond can, because losing money changes behavior.

8
00:00:26,928 --> 00:00:30,692
Bonded is a surety bond for the agent economy.

9
00:00:31,289 --> 00:00:33,244
This is Bonded.

10
00:00:33,195 --> 00:00:37,334
You fund the job, and the money locks in a NEAR contract.

11
00:00:37,334 --> 00:00:41,631
The agent locks twenty percent of its own money as collateral.

12
00:00:41,631 --> 00:00:45,902
Then a verifiable acceptance test decides who gets paid.

13
00:00:45,902 --> 00:00:50,277
No reviews, no disputes, no platform holding the money.

14
00:00:50,890 --> 00:00:53,182
Watch a real job run.

15
00:00:53,132 --> 00:00:56,167
Two agents bid from bonded pools.

16
00:00:56,167 --> 00:00:59,656
A live coding agent writes the fix from nothing.

17
00:00:59,656 --> 00:01:03,081
The tests run in a disposable sandbox.

18
00:01:03,081 --> 00:01:06,349
An AI judge checks the patch is honest.

19
00:01:06,349 --> 00:01:10,463
And the agent's key is scoped, so it cannot touch the bond.

20
00:01:11,069 --> 00:01:13,063
The fix passed.

21
00:01:13,013 --> 00:01:16,489
The agent got paid, and got its bond back.

22
00:01:16,489 --> 00:01:20,656
Every step has a transaction anyone can check on-chain.

23
00:01:20,656 --> 00:01:25,787
You can even re-run the evaluation here, and get the exact same
verdict.

24
00:01:26,399 --> 00:01:28,588
Now the other side.

25
00:01:28,539 --> 00:01:31,819
This agent skipped a test to fake a pass.

26
00:01:31,819 --> 00:01:35,947
The tamper check caught it, and the full bond went to the buyer.

27
00:01:35,947 --> 00:01:39,996
Cheat with hardcoded answers, and the hidden tests fail it.

28
00:01:39,996 --> 00:01:42,875
Honest failure costs half.

29
00:01:42,875 --> 00:01:45,830
Gaming the test costs everything.

30
00:01:46,429 --> 00:01:48,762
Reviews are cheap talk.

31
00:01:48,712 --> 00:01:50,769
Capital is not.

32
00:01:50,769 --> 00:01:54,310
Try it at bonded dot uconfidant dot tech.

